   "type": "enum",
   "enum": [
    "appendix_b",
    "appendix_b1",
    "maker_unstated"
   ],
   "description": "Basis of a volume or kWh figure. Current US freezer figures are 10 CFR 430 Subpart B Appendix B (adjusted volume = 1.73 x freezer volume); pre-2014 filings used Appendix B1 with a different factor, so they do not compare. ES 8t9c-g3tn rows are current-procedure by construction (Version 5.0 specification, effective 2014-09-15)."
  }
